# Factory My Secrets manifest — names only (safe to commit).
# Lives at the kit-collective repo root. Values live in the main checkout's gitignored
# `.env`: bb secret request GH_TOKEN LINEAR_API_KEY --write-env <main checkout>/.env
# Do not list DATABASE_URL or lane product secrets.
# Deliberately not listed (not used today): Coolify, OpenRouter, Cursor, PI_MODEL*,
# Linear webhooks / Pi app. Add a name here only when something reads it.

GH_TOKEN
LINEAR_API_KEY
OPERATOR_EMAIL
# Max's Linear app (LINEAR_ACTOR=max in scripts/linear.mjs, staff/max.md). The watchdog heals them.
LINEAR_MAX_CLIENT_ID
LINEAR_MAX_CLIENT_SECRET
# The scenarios CLI's own token for the Holdout repo only (KIT-366, docs/agents/scenarios.md).
SCENARIOS_GH_TOKEN
